\fs26 \AppleTypeServices \cf0 \strokec2 A 20\'d720 automotive electronics booth in Las Vegas must be planned around product display sequencing, controlled lighting, union labor workflow, freight timing, and clean installation readiness. In a SEMA environment, compact devices and car audio components compete against oversized visuals and constant motion, so the booth had to stay open for walk-up interaction while still protecting displays, preserving product legibility, and maintaining a clean perimeter presentation from move-in through opening.\
\
\
\
\
