\cf6 \cb4 Q: What is the most overlooked detail in car audio booth execution?\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb4 A: Lighting and display spacing. If smaller products are crowded together or lit inconsistently, the booth loses legibility and the technology feels less premium.\cb1 \
